EmbeddingGemma 2 (ONNX build used by Onset)

This folder contains a modified form of EmbeddingGemma 2 by Google DeepMind
(https://huggingface.co/google/embeddinggemma-2, revision f9972ac22e696a105c482202646979e33e4b5a1e),
licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (see LICENSE). The model card links its licence at
https://ai.google.dev/gemma/docs/gemma_4_license and asks that deployments follow the Gemma Prohibited Use Policy
(https://ai.google.dev/gemma/prohibited_use_policy).

Modifications by Whissle (scripts/native/export_embed.py, scripts/native/quantize_embed.py in the Onset repository):
- the text and audio towers were exported to ONNX; the vision tower is not included;
- the matrix-multiply weights were quantised to 8 bits (ONNX Runtime MatMulNBits, block 32, symmetric);
- the token embedding table is stored as int8 rows with one float scale per row (embed_tokens.npz);
- audio_frontend.npz holds the Gemma 4 audio feature extractor's window and mel filter bank (computed with
  Hugging Face Transformers, Apache License 2.0).
tokenizer.json and config_sentence_transformers.json are the upstream files, unchanged.
